# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so everything here is transferred on every build —
# over the network when the daemon is minikube's. Trim what the build never reads.
# Note: src/main/resources/models/ is deliberately NOT excluded; the reranker ONNX model
# is packaged onto the jar's classpath and the Kubernetes deployment relies on it.
.git
.github
.gradle
build
.idea
claude
k8s
# Never let local credentials into the build context (the final stage copies only the
# jar, so they would not reach the image today — this keeps it that way).
secrets
docker-compose.yml
